@page "/who-we-are"
@using SaveNEIN.Client.Pages
@using SaveNEIN.Client.Components

<PageTitle>Who We Are | Save Northeast Indiana</PageTitle>

<section class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 py-24 dark:bg-[#0B1221] [--fc-card:#ffffff] [--fc-card-border:#cbd5e1] [--fc-text:#0f172a] [--fc-muted:#64748b] [--fc-surface:#f8fafc] [--fc-surface-border:#e2e8f0] [--fc-heading:#334155] [--fc-line:#94a3b8] dark:[--fc-card:#0f172a] dark:[--fc-card-border:#334155] dark:[--fc-text:#f8fafc] dark:[--fc-muted:#94a3b8] dark:[--fc-surface:#1e293b] dark:[--fc-surface-border:#334155] dark:[--fc-heading:#e2e8f0] dark:[--fc-line:#475569]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <!-- Section Header -->
        <div class="section-heading-block mb-16 max-w-3xl text-center mx-auto">
            <span class="section-eyebrow text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">Save<span class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">NE</span>IN Grassroot Coalitions</span>
            <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl">
                Who We <span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">Are</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="section-heading-description mt-4 text-xl italic font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                Grassroot coalitions of citizens responding swiftly, efficiently, and with compassion.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Narrative & Combined Image -->
        <div class="mb-16 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-surface-dark sm:p-8 lg:p-10">
            <div class="grid items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
                    <img src="assets/who-we-are/coallitions-combined.png"
                         alt="The Coalition for a Better Indiana and County Coalitions"
                         class="max-h-96 w-auto object-contain" />
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 lg:col-span-7">
                    <p>
                        In 2014 a group of concerned citizens fought against a casino initiative in downtown Fort Wayne at the grassroots level. That group operated under the name of <strong>the Coalition for a Better Fort Wayne</strong>. When a casino tried again in 2024 in New Haven, the group of concerned citizens fought again, this time under the name of <strong>The Coalition for a Better Allen Co.</strong> Both times, this grassroots effort won and kept the community free from the ills that predatory gaming brings.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        This newly formed NFP wanted to stay true to the idea of a grassroots coalition of citizens, hence <strong>The Coalition for a Better Indiana, Coalition for a Better Indiana Action, Inc.</strong> The county-focused coalitions in Steuben, Allen, and DeKalb are operated by this statewide coalition, while each remains focused on its own community. We don't want to be a large, single-issue organization. Instead, we can respond to the needs of our neighbors swiftly, efficiently, with decades of experience and compassion.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4 Related Organizations Grid -->
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
            <!-- 1. The Coalition for a Better Indiana -->
            <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-surface-dark sm:p-8">
                <div>
                    <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-bold text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-400 mb-3">
                        Statewide
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-2xl mb-3">
                        The Coalition for a Better Indiana
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        The Coalition for a Better Indiana Action, Inc. is the statewide non-profit grassroots coalition that operates the county-focused coalitions in Steuben, Allen, and DeKalb while advocating for sustainable community growth, independent economic transparency, and family-first policies across Indiana.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                    <AppButton Href="https://www.facebook.com/betterin.org"
                               Target="_blank"
                               Rel="noopener noreferrer"
                               Class="bg-[#1877f2] hover:bg-[#0f5ecc] text-white">
                        <svg class="size-4 fill-current mr-1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/>
                        </svg>
                        Facebook
                    </AppButton>
                    <AppButton Href="https://www.betterin.org/"
                               Target="_blank"
                               Rel="noopener noreferrer"
                               Icon="language"
                               Class="bg-[#c8963e] hover:bg-[#b5832d] text-white font-bold">
                        betterin.org
                    </AppButton>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- 2. The Coalition for a Better Steuben County -->
            <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-surface-dark sm:p-8">
                <div>
                    <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-bold text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-400 mb-3">
                        Steuben County
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-2xl mb-3">
                        The Coalition for a Better Steuben County
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        A grassroots coalition in Steuben County uniting residents, lake community stewards, and local business leaders to protect the county's tourism, natural heritage, and quality of life.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                    <AppButton Href="https://www.facebook.com/BetterSteubenCoIN"
                               Target="_blank"
                               Rel="noopener noreferrer"
                               Class="bg-[#1877f2] hover:bg-[#0f5ecc] text-white">
                        <svg class="size-4 fill-current mr-1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/>
                        </svg>
                        Facebook
                    </AppButton>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- 3. The Coalition for a Better Allen County -->
            <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-surface-dark sm:p-8">
                <div>
                    <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-bold text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-400 mb-3">
                        Allen County
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-2xl mb-3">
                        The Coalition for a Better Allen County
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        Grassroots organization uniting Fort Wayne and Allen County residents, business owners, and faith leaders to defend local commerce, neighborhoods, and family security.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                    <AppButton Href="https://www.facebook.com/BetterAllenCoIN"
                               Target="_blank"
                               Rel="noopener noreferrer"
                               Class="bg-[#1877f2] hover:bg-[#0f5ecc] text-white">
                        <svg class="size-4 fill-current mr-1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/>
                        </svg>
                        Facebook
                    </AppButton>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- 4. The Coalition for a Better DeKalb County -->
            <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-surface-dark sm:p-8">
                <div>
                    <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-bold text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-400 mb-3">
                        DeKalb County
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-2xl mb-3">
                        The Coalition for a Better DeKalb County
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        Community coalition protecting DeKalb County's manufacturing strength, agricultural roots, and local families from the negative social and economic impacts of predatory gaming.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                    <AppButton Href="https://www.facebook.com/BetterDeKalbCoIN"
                               Target="_blank"
                               Rel="noopener noreferrer"
                               Class="bg-[#1877f2] hover:bg-[#0f5ecc] text-white">
                        <svg class="size-4 fill-current mr-1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/>
                        </svg>
                        Facebook
                    </AppButton>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<Footer />
